    PositiveAt (α:=α) M H hH W bslot (a/max 1 b) b bΦ Bmask L Lslot lo hi
      Mcap εchild κ Z η₀ Q degree S C₁ →
    ∀(w σ freq:α→ℝ)(v height mesh:ℝ),
