    ∀st:NaturalState Z Bmask bΦ,st.puncture=1 → st.fixedModulus=internalQ Q η₀ → st.width≤Mcap →
    ∀p:Profiles a b,∀X₁ X₂:ℝ,∀hX₁:0<X₁,∀hX₂:0<X₂,X₁≤Z^L → X₂≤Z^L →
